# Playbook-AI Context (Bree + Grelin)

> Persisted context for playbook-ai development across machines. Bree-ai is the main source; grelin-ai holds medical playbooks.

---

## Repos & Paths

| Repo | Path | Branch | Role |
|------|------|--------|------|
| **bree-ai** | `devel/bree-ai` | master | Main playbook-ai source, core UI/server |
| **grelin-ai** | `devel/GrelinHealth/grelin-ai` | main | Medical playbooks (wound-ai, enm-ai, derm-ai, etc.) |

**Git remotes:**
- bree-ai: `https://github.com/jcrupi/bree-ai`
- grelin-ai: `git@github.com:GrelinhealthTeam/grelin-ai.git`

---

## Core Playbook-AI (bree-ai)

- **Location:** `apps/playbook-ai/`
- **Run:** `bun run dev:playbook` (root) or `bun run dev` (from apps/playbook-ai)
- **Playbooks:** `apps/playbook-ai/agentx/playbook/` (Bree catalog + wound-ai synced from grelin)

---

## Catalog Architecture

- **Bree catalog:** Local (1040-simple, hipaa, disability, fmla, aml-kyc, gdpr-breach, ediscovery, wound-ai)
- **Grelin catalog:** Medical specialties (wound-ai, enm-ai, derm-ai, pain-ai, urgent-ai, dme-ai, behavioral-health-ai)
- **Target design:** Catalogs as URL pointers; core fetches from external repos. See `apps/playbook-ai/agentx/playbook-catalog-architecture.agentx.md`

---

## playbookX

- **Per catalog:** bree playbookX for Bree catalog; grelin playbookX for Grelin catalog
- **Location in bree:** `apps/playbook-ai/playbookx/`
- **Commands:** `playbookx validate`, `playbookx watch`, `playbookx generate`

---

## Sync Workflow (wound-ai)

- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/sync-wound-ai-playbook.yml`
- **Source:** `GrelinhealthTeam/grelin-ai` @ `apps/wound-ai/agentx/playbook/`
- **Target:** `apps/playbook-ai/agentx/playbook/wound-ai.*.agentx-v1.md`
- **Trigger:** `gh workflow run "Sync Wound-AI Playbook"` or weekly (Mondays 04:00 UTC)
- **Private repo:** Add `WOUND_AI_TOKEN` secret if grelin-ai is private

---

## Reconciliation Workflow

1. **Workspace:** Open bree-ai as main; add grelin-ai folder (multi-root)
2. **Design doc:** `apps/playbook-ai/agentx/playbook-catalog-architecture.agentx.md`
3. **Grelin wound-ai playbooks:** `grelin-ai/apps/wound-ai/agentx/playbook/` (canonical)
4. **Sync script (grelin):** `scripts/sync-playbooks-to-bree.sh` — copies from grelin to bree

---

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `apps/playbook-ai/shared/specialty-config.ts` | Catalog + specialty config, appRoot paths |
| `apps/playbook-ai/server/src/playbook-loader.ts` | Loads playbooks (supports appRoot) |
| `apps/playbook-ai/agentx/playbook-catalog-architecture.agentx.md` | Architecture design |

