## Workspace Setup (Mac / other box)

```bash
# Pull both
cd bree-ai && git pull
cd ../GrelinHealth/grelin-ai && git pull

# Multi-root workspace (optional)
# File → Add Folder to Workspace → add grelin-ai
# Save as bree-playbook.code-workspace
```
